{
  "title": "White Wine Peruvian Fish Skewers",
  "description": "A light and flavorful Peruvian dish featuring white wine and fish, cooked to perfection on a cedar plank. This recipe is low in carbs and perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
  "diet": [
    "low-carb",
